@startuml
title 同步等待、超时扫描与迟到响应

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "Consumer 调用线程" as Caller
participant "HeaderExchangeChannel" as Exchange
participant "DefaultFuture" as Future
participant "Netty Channel" as Network
participant "Provider 业务线程" as Provider
participant "超时扫描线程" as Scanner

Caller -> Exchange: request(invocation, timeout)
Exchange -> Future: new DefaultFuture(channel, request, timeout)
Future -> Future: FUTURES.put(requestId, future)
Exchange -> Network: send(request)
Network -> Provider: Request
Caller -> Future: get(timeout)
Future -> Future: Condition.await(...)

alt Provider 在超时前返回
  Provider --> Network: Response(requestId)
  Network -> Future: received(channel, response)
  Future -> Future: remove(requestId)\nset response + signal()
  Future --> Caller: RpcResult
else Consumer 等待超时
  Future --> Caller: get(timeout) 可先抛出 TimeoutException
  Scanner -> Future: 扫描后构造 timeoutResponse
  Future -> Future: received(timeoutResponse)\nremove + signal()
  note over Caller,Scanner
  get 与扫描线程存在先后竞态；
  扫描线程还负责从全局 Map 回收 Future。
  end note
  note over Provider
  Consumer 超时不会发送取消指令，
  Provider 业务线程继续执行。
  end note
  Provider --> Network: 迟到的 Response(requestId)
  Network -> Future: received(channel, response)
  Future -> Future: 找不到 requestId，记录迟到响应日志
end
@enduml
